/**
 * Type entry for the `@tanstack/react-query` shim
 * (`stubs/extensions/tanstack-react-query-shim.mjs.stub`).
 * `npm run build:types` bundles it into
 * `tanstack-react-query-shim.d.mts.stub`: the names the shim exports, the
 * types of the library, and the host's module namespace as the default
 * export.
